    faults: [["No recent handshake", "Check public keys, endpoint, UDP path/NAT, listener, time, and outer capture.", "Restore authenticated outer peer reachability."], ["Handshake works but LAN traffic fails", "Check inner routes, AllowedIPs both sides, forwarding, firewall, NAT overlap, and return path.", "Correct the exact inner prefix/policy dependency."]],
    fieldUse: "WireGuard provides a small, auditable VPN model well suited to network labs, management overlays, and modern site-to-site designs.",
